One judgment call I left open for the audit: the 83 m² empty walled alcove in the east boundary bump-out (x 1223–1279, y 470–633) is left walkable. It has no fixtures, labels, or directory destination, but it sits inside the extracted sales-floor boundary and opens onto the floor through a 3.1 m gap with no door drawn — so I had no positive evidence to bless it as staff.
